# Cache rules for Cloudflare Assets.
#
# The /_astro/* rule has to be written out here. The Cloudflare adapter injects
# it only when it is generating this file from scratch — the moment a source
# `public/_headers` exists it stops, and the year-long immutable caching on
# every hashed asset silently disappears. Checked against a build: with this
# file present and the rule omitted, dist/client/_headers contained only `/*`.
#
# Everything on this site is prerendered except `/`, the two form pages and
# `/api/*`. Without an HTML rule, every page view invoked the Worker and came
# back `cf-cache-status: DYNAMIC` — the edge held nothing, so a visitor in
# Muscat paid a round trip to origin for HTML that had not changed in a week.
#
# Reading the HTML values below:
#
#   max-age=0, must-revalidate   the BROWSER always checks back, so nobody is
#                                served a stale page out of their own cache
#   s-maxage=600                 the EDGE serves it for ten minutes
#   stale-while-revalidate       past that, the edge answers immediately with
#                                the old copy and refreshes behind the request,
#                                so no visitor ever waits for a revalidation
#
# The cost: copy edited through manage mode takes up to ten minutes to reach
# other people rather than appearing at once. That is the trade for edge
# caching and there is no setting that gives both. It is tolerable here because
# ContactSync patches the phone number and email into the page client-side, so
# the details most likely to be corrected in a hurry are not frozen in the HTML.
# If page copy ever needs to go live instantly, lower s-maxage.
#
# /api/* is deliberately absent. Those routes set `cache-control: no-store` on
# their own responses, and an origin header beats a rule in this file.

# Hashed filenames, so the content behind one can never change.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Everything else: pages.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, s-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
